WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:19.700
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

2
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:27.104
Tap Management, in the row under the two big buttons.

3
00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:30.290
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

4
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:34.519
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

5
00:00:34.519 --> 00:00:40.185
Type your PIN.

6
00:00:40.185 --> 00:00:45.678
Then tap Unlock.

7
00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:51.402
This is the Instructor Panel: Records, Add New and Export.

8
00:00:51.402 --> 00:00:57.129
Somebody forgot to check out? You can correct it here.

9
00:00:57.129 --> 00:01:03.914
Find their row and tap Edit Time.

10
00:01:03.914 --> 00:01:08.351
Each time has a switch beside it.

11
00:01:08.351 --> 00:01:14.147
Turn the check-out on.

12
00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:19.847
Set the time they actually left.

13
00:01:19.847 --> 00:01:29.843
Say why. This is optional, but it is what the change log will show.

14
00:01:29.843 --> 00:01:38.267
Tap Review Override.
